WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.574
Own a rental in Memphis but live thirteen time zones away?

00:00:04.574 --> 00:00:10.259
It's two a.m. The kitchen faucet is leaking. You don't need to be awake.

00:00:10.259 --> 00:00:15.204
Every repair arrives with a cost band benchmarked against similar Memphis jobs.

00:00:15.204 --> 00:00:20.519
Non-urgent decisions are batched into one morning digest, in your own time zone.

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:25.833
Each memo proposes a default. Approve in seconds, or simply let it stand.

00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:31.148
AI triages and prices. A coordinator or owner approves. Every step is logged.

00:00:31.148 --> 00:00:36.463
Leak and HVAC sensors can open a ticket before anyone has to phone.

00:00:36.463 --> 00:00:41.778
Residents pay rent and report repairs with a photo, all from one app.

00:00:41.778 --> 00:00:46.752
Own in Memphis, live anywhere. Start with a free rental analysis.
